en spaces\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 39,\n      \"question\": \"Which word best describes the author's tone towards vertical gardens?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"Disapproving\",\n        \"Neutral\",\n        \"Optimistic\",\n        \"Nonchalant\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"Optimistic\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\n      \"question\": \"What can be inferred about the author's belief regarding urban living?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"They advocate for more industrial development\",\n        \"They support innovative solutions to city problems\",\n        \"They believe that urban areas should be completely redesigned\",\n        \"They think that vertical gardens are a temporary trend\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"They support innovative solutions to city problems\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
